    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsyryW1MI5SyVYrvG77oEGkETqP4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Hi，我是韩克，今天我邀请到的嘉宾是：</span></p><span></span><p><span>顾思妤｜U·NEED 普拉提 | 创始人</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们聊的话题是：</span><strong><span>到底该如何定义“精品馆”？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:00:16</a> &nbsp;在精品馆的定义中：到底什么才算是精品？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">00:01:05</a> &nbsp;关于“精神、精准、精进”的解读是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">00:02:24</a> &nbsp;“品质”在精品馆中的表现形式有哪些呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">00:03:04</a> &nbsp;“品味”在精品馆中的表现形式有哪些呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">00:03:35</a> &nbsp;“品牌”在精品馆中的表现形式有哪些呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">00:05:37</a> &nbsp;精品馆的竞争，做加法和做减法哪个更难？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区和我们分享你听完本期播客的听后感，</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一条评论我都会认真看。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>有些人，这一生注定会走到一起。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkcPZIzaezARzypOE7BIl5wAe67s.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Hi，你好，我是韩克，健身行业咨询顾问；</span></p><span></span><p><span>如一咨询和MFT心武格斗健身的创始人、3F健身管理的联合创始人、耐克签约教练导师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我曾作为职业经理人带过年销售额近亿的团队；创业后为300个品牌、2000家俱乐部、3W名教练提供培训和咨询服务。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjU-3HCzp986bPRVlgKAYqSdneEg.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FumoCLdNw2tmF-Tn6Af8reo_XgwR.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhfOKYnnfZLevdMRkg3lXqSqE746.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
