    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsQ3mLaOCIbRhgGAKYHA3dsnYqYe.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Hi，我是韩克，今天我邀请到的嘉宾是：冯余冰｜ 莱美中国 | 市场部经理&amp;汪杰｜威克健身团课总监| adidas合作教练</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们聊的话题是：</span><strong><span>超越会籍的纽带关系</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">00:02:52</a> &nbsp;威克健身的主要特点和经营理念是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">00:18:34</a> &nbsp;威克健身是如何制定和执行长期规划的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">00:26:15</a> &nbsp;如何让新入会会员乐意参与到团课当中？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1811">00:30:11</a> &nbsp;提供跟动力相关的知识在会员中的作用？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">00:35:15</a> &nbsp;提升锻炼动力和持续到店的具体方法是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2827">00:47:07</a> &nbsp;分享站在未来看现在与站在细节看全局。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4625">01:17:05</a> &nbsp;威克健身目前为止转介绍的效果是怎样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5245">01:27:25</a> &nbsp;如果可以您希望得到莱美哪方面的支持？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5518">01:31:58</a> &nbsp;如何才能帮助到俱乐部成功经营和管理？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5580">01:33:00</a> &nbsp;莱美体系超越会籍的纽带关系都有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区和我们分享你听完本期播客的听后感，</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一条评论我都会认真看。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>有些人，这一生注定会走到一起。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqXvO_Wr_nEg2ae4D76VRhI6FHL_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Hi，你好，我是韩克，健身行业咨询顾问；</span></p><span></span><p><span>如一咨询和MFT心武格斗健身的创始人、3F健身管理的联合创始人、耐克签约教练导师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我曾作为职业经理人带过年销售额近亿的团队；创业后为300个品牌、2000家俱乐部、3W名教练提供培训和咨询服务。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpRDLQpGJucqWiluTgxJox1KZxuk.jpg"></figure>